{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダニ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNE3RCSVJ2K7ZBK60RNS99","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生いちご牛乳🍓🥛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮るセンス無さすぎて、ダニに花瓶みたいって言われた･･･"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNE4SZB3WE6BXE60NHQXHM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こっちは、成功"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNE5SBN591J5Y7VKHFW41P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nおお〜\n全然違う!(笑)\n映えって難しい･･･\nダニがコップの角度に気をつけてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かき氷🍧"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNE6RVNHAS1GFP6RMQK66X","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダニがサツマイモ🍠私がいちご🍓\n帰りは、寒すぎて凍えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダニと2ヶ月くらいぶりに話したよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったです。\nダニは毎日、幸せそうです。\n私もダニのおかげで今日は幸せでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ザンビ頑張れ〜\n次は、映画見ようね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"巻いたよ!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNE7TMD53YN76VT5X2592G","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYNE8V1QM4PMPP9X0PQMC0Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3Dケープしないと巻き巻きが取れちゃうことに気づきました🙃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}